     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear User,<div><br></div><div>There is a new pipeline for running TITAN to perform copy number analysis in whole genome and exome sequencing data.  </div><div>You can obtain the pipeline from <a href=\"https://github.com/MO-BCCRC/titan_workflow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/MO-BCCRC/titan_workflow&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235405253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16ULZN-gtC93D0CdXy6NbG\">https://github.com/MO-BCCRC/titan_workflow</a>.  This pipeline is based on the <a href=\"https://pypi.python.org/pypi/kronos-pipeliner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://pypi.python.org/pypi/kronos-pipeliner&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235405253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LPL0V7E6l__7wMvzQwyOL\">KRONOS</a> workflow (<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Verdana,Geneva,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.biorxiv.org/content/early/2016/02/22/040352.abstract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biorxiv.org/content/early/2016/02/22/040352.abstract&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235405253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YmPZh_RNd6bBqM5Nch60T\"><font size=\"2\">Taghiyar et al, 2016</font></a><span style=\"font-size:15px\">).</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Verdana,Geneva,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">TITANRunner is now deprecated and will not be supported.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Verdana,Geneva,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Verdana,Geneva,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Verdana, Geneva, Bitstream Vera Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">I would like to thank Diljot Grewal, Ali Bashashati, and Jafar Taghiyar from the <a href=\"http://compbio.bccrc.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://compbio.bccrc.ca&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235405253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2efuU5Bl2Wmbeucptub3T2\">Shah Lab</a> at the BC Cancer Agency for creating this pipeline.</font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Verdana,Geneva,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Verdana,Geneva,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Thank you for your interest in TITAN.</span><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Verdana, Geneva, Bitstream Vera Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Verdana, Geneva, Bitstream Vera Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Best,</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Verdana, Geneva, Bitstream Vera Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">Gavin Ha, Ph.D.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">Postdoctoral Research Fellow</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">Laboratory of Matthew Meyerson</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">Dana-Farber Cancer Institute </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">Broad Institute of Harvard and MIT</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">415 Main Street, Cambridge, MA 02142</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);fo